# A held C major chord on the chord track: registration swept cello -> full with the ensemble off (P2 0), then
# back down with the classic ensemble on (P2 153). The tone and the footages morph without steps.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 1.5
track chord
param attack 20
param sustain 255
param release 60
param p2 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
param p2 153 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 32
note 0 C3 32 110
note 0 E3 32 110
note 0 G3 32 110
note 0 C4 32 110
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 48
expect peak_below -3
